    "key_formulas": "Vernier: Total = Main Scale Reading + (Vernier Scale Reading × Vernier Constant 0.01 cm)\nMicrometer: Total = Sleeve Reading (mm) + (Thimble Reading × 0.01 mm)\nDimension of Force = [M L T⁻²]\nDimension of Work / Energy = [M L² T⁻²]\nDimension of Power = [M L² T⁻³]\nDimension of Pressure = [M L⁻¹ T⁻²]",
